---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Layout title="Legal Notice | López Márquez Abogados" description="Website information, contact channels and terms of use." noindex={true}>
<PageHero eyebrow="Legal information" title="Legal Notice" description="General information and terms governing use of this website." />
<section class="section"><div class="container prose">
  <h2>1. Website and contact</h2>
  <p><strong>{site.name}</strong></p>
  <p>Contact address: {site.address.street}, {site.address.postalCode} {site.address.locality}, {site.address.region}.</p>
  <p>Email: <a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a> · Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</p>
  <h2>2. Nature of the information</h2>
  <p>Website content is general information. It does not replace the review of the documents, dates and circumstances of a particular matter and does not by itself constitute acceptance of a professional engagement.</p>
  <p>Submitting a form, email or message does not by itself suspend or interrupt a legal deadline. If a deadline is approaching, call and verify the calculation against the relevant documents.</p>
  <h2>3. Content updates</h2>
  <p>Legislation, procedures and their application may change. Where an official source is linked, consult the current text and check whether the rule applies to the particular circumstances.</p>
  <h2>4. Intellectual property and links</h2>
  <p>Website content and elements are protected by applicable law. Links to third-party websites are provided as references; their content and terms are controlled by those providers.</p>
  <h2>5. Privacy</h2>
  <p>Information about personal data submitted through this website is available in the <a href="/en/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/en/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
</div></section>
</Layout>
